@startuml
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System
participant "Deezer" as Deezer

activate User

User -> System: asks to play the preview of a track
alt preview already known for this track
  System --> User: plays the preview
else not known yet
  System -> Deezer: searches the preview by artist and track title
  Deezer --> System: returns the preview URL (or none)
  opt none found
    System -> Deezer: searches the album previews by artist and album title
    Deezer --> System: returns the previews by track title
  end
  alt preview available
    System --> User: plays the preview and shows the pause button
  else not available
    System --> User: informs that the preview is unavailable
  else error
    System --> User: informs that the preview failed
  end
end

User -> System: asks to pause the preview
System --> User: pauses the preview

User -> System: asks to resume the preview
System --> User: resumes the preview

note right of System
  Only one track plays at a time (30 s).
  The preview stops when it ends or when
  the app goes to the background.
end note

@enduml
